      "title": "File:Launchpad 39B, Kennedy Space Center (6067864751).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Launchpad_39B%2C_Kennedy_Space_Center_%286067864751%29.jpg",
